1
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,700
Take this path to the small west building.

2
00:00:09,366 --> 00:00:09,833
He's good-looking.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,233
No, stop looking.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:12,833
Just one more look. Just one.

5
00:00:14,166 --> 00:00:16,666
Right, you're the one brought over today.

6
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:18,366
You know me?

7
00:00:18,866 --> 00:00:19,766
Thanat's confidant.

8
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:21,733
Nawin, stop staring.

9
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,900
I'm Nawin, not "the one brought over."

10
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:25,900
Nawin. Got it.

11
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:28,833
What's your name?

12
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,300
Did Thanat send you here for me?

13
00:00:33,166 --> 00:00:35,600
I'm not here for you. Just call me Ah Tan.

14
00:00:37,133 --> 00:00:41,633
The butler said only the general manager's closest people
live in the small building. Told me not to cause trouble.

15
00:00:43,233 --> 00:00:44,866
You... live in that small building?

16
00:00:46,033 --> 00:00:49,366
Yeah. The main house is too noisy. I prefer it there.

17
00:00:49,466 --> 00:00:50,933
What's your relationship with Thanat, anyway?

18
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,166
Can we not talk about him right now?

19
00:00:55,133 --> 00:00:58,133
If I tell him who I am now, will he still talk to me?

20
00:00:59,366 --> 00:01:00,166
Better not say anything yet.

21
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,066
He's holding me here. I need to know if you're his man.

22
00:01:06,066 --> 00:01:08,133
And if I am, you won't talk to me anymore?

23
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:12,200
If you're here to talk me into behaving, don't bother.

24
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:16,200
I'm not. Whatever you want to say, I'm listening.

25
00:01:16,633 --> 00:01:17,233
Probably his lover.

26
00:01:17,666 --> 00:01:19,400
So the general manager is holding me, huh?

27
00:01:19,666 --> 00:01:20,833
Then I'll just mess with his man.

28
00:01:20,833 --> 00:01:22,633
Nawin, don't chicken out.

29
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:25,700
Did you paint this?

30
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:28,000
Yeah. It's not finished yet.

31
00:01:31,166 --> 00:01:31,966
You studied art?

32
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:33,433
Just graduated.

33
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:39,633
I'm heading back to keep painting.

34
00:01:40,833 --> 00:01:41,033
Okay.

35
00:01:41,433 --> 00:01:43,300
Or... want to come over to my place and watch for a while?
